0 -14 Td
/F2 9 Tf
(  * Shang : patrilineal clan, lineage house) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F2 9 Tf
(  * Kashan : customary law of clan exogamy) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 8 Tf
(    Analysis: Fundamental marital taboo and governance rule.) Tj
0 -12 Td
/F2 9 Tf
(  * Kashansha : incestuous breach of clan exogamy) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 8 Tf
(    Analysis: Social transgression incurring ostracism.) Tj
0 -12 Td
