0 -16 Td
/F1 8 Tf
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(When evidence in boundary or theft disputes is ambiguous and witnesses) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(are divided, the dispute is resolved by Tuishot \(the solemn oath before) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(earth and heaven\). The disputing parties bite a tiger tooth \(Haram-ha\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(or plunge stones into sacred water, invoking divine retribution upon) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(whoever utters falsehood. The fear of ancestral and cosmic retribution) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(ensured near-absolute truthfulness in customary legal proceedings.) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 8 Tf
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
